<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1687) <span class="when">Oct 17, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The Timecode window.</b> View &#9656; Timecode Window shows the playhead in a window of its own: drag it anywhere, resize it and the numbers grow with it. Frames, timecode or both, under the file&#8217;s name; A and B while comparing.</li>
<li><b>Clicking a floating window brings Asobi Review to the front.</b></li>
<li><b>File &#9656; New Window (&#8984;N)</b> replaces New Tab.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
